<title>USA: Chase Manhattan to redeem preferred shrs.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan to redeem preferred shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp Thursday said it will redeem all outstanding shares of its 8-3/8 percent and 8-1/2 percent preferred stock, each at a redemption price of $25 per share on June 30.</p>
<p>The company said dividends will cease to accrue from, and after, that date.</p>
